### FNPIS API Test Collection
### Base: http://localhost:8080
### Swagger UI: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
###
### Usage:
###   VS Code REST Client extension: open this file, click "Send Request" above each block.
###   Postman: import as raw text (File > Import > Raw text).
###   IntelliJ: built-in HTTP client supports this format natively.
###   curl: copy the URL and body from each section.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Health
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module A — Portfolios & Holdings
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

### List all portfolios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios

### Create a portfolio
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "美股测试账户"
}

### Get portfolio summary (use the id from create response)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1/summary

### Add a holding to portfolio 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1/holdings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "AAPL",
  "quantity": 100,
  "costBasis": "175.50"
}

### List holdings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1/holdings

### Delete portfolio
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module B — Quote Refresh (行情报价)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Manual quote refresh — triggers fetch for all watchlist symbols.
### Returns 202 Accepted immediately; the refresh runs asynchronously.
### Returns 409 Conflict if a refresh is already running.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/quotes/refresh

### Concurrency test: fire twice rapidly — second should return 409
### (Run this immediately after the first one, or use a script)

<<<<<<< HEAD
### Get latest quote for a symbol (B1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/prices/AAPL/quote

### Get quote for unknown symbol — returns 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/prices/XYZQ/quote

### Portfolio valuation history (B2/F5) — default 30 days
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1/valuation-history

### Valuation history with date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolios/1/valuation-history?from=2026-07-01&to=2026-07-29

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module C — News (新闻聚合)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

### News list — default last 7 days, page 1 (C3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news

### News list — filtered by symbol (C4)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news?symbol=AAPL&page=1&size=10

### News list — filtered by sentiment
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news?sentiment=POSITIVE

### News list — with date range
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news?from=2026-07-20&to=2026-07-29&size=5

### Single news article detail (C5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news/1

### News detail — not found (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news/99999

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Module C — News Refresh (新闻手动刷新)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

### Manual news refresh — fetches company news for every watchlist symbol.
### Returns JSON: { triggered, fetched, inserted, skippedDuplicates, failures }
###   triggered:          true if accepted, false on conflict
###   fetched:            number of symbols successfully called
###   inserted:           new article-link rows created
###   skippedDuplicates:  links that already existed (dedup working)
###   failures:           persistence attempts that threw an exception
### Returns 409 Conflict if a fetch is already running.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/news/refresh

### Dedupe test: fire twice — second should return inserted=0,
### proving external_id uniqueness is working (SC-005).
### All articles should appear as skippedDuplicates.

### Concurrency test: fire twice rapidly — second should return 409.
### (Run this immediately after the first one)

